#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:638
#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:697
msgid "Out of stock badge"
msgstr "Badge de rupture"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:638
msgid "A small badge on values whose variations are all out of stock. Its text is set in the Texts tab."
msgstr "Un petit badge sur les valeurs dont toutes les variations sont en rupture. Son texte se règle dans l’onglet Textes."

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:639
msgid "Show the badge on out-of-stock values"
msgstr "Afficher le badge sur les valeurs en rupture"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:639
msgid "The value stays clickable, so customers can still see its price and stock message. Shop page swatches are faded and struck through."
msgstr "La valeur reste cliquable : le client voit toujours son prix et le message de stock. Sur les pages boutique, la pastille est estompée et barrée."

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:643
msgid "Badge position"
msgstr "Position du badge"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:646
msgid "In the top corner of the swatch"
msgstr "Dans le coin supérieur de la vignette"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:647
msgid "Under the text"
msgstr "Sous le texte"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:651
msgid "Badge color"
msgstr "Couleur du badge"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:651
msgid "Empty: dark grey. The text is white."
msgstr "Vide : gris foncé. Le texte est blanc."

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:654
msgid "Typography"
msgstr "Typographie"

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:654
msgid "Sizes of the texts inside a swatch. 0 keeps a size relative to your theme font."
msgstr "Tailles des textes dans une vignette. 0 garde une taille relative à la police du thème."

#: includes/class-saito-swatches-admin.php:655
